  "content": "<h1 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; line-height: 2rem; margin-top: 1rem;\">操作步骤</h1>\n<ol>\n<li>下载插件AIPex</li>\n</ol>\n<div><a href=\"https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/aipex/iglkpadagfelcpmiidndgjgafpdifnke\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/aipex/iglkpadagfelcpmiidndgjgafpdifnke</a></div>\n<ul>\n<li>这个插件是用来做浏览器自动化的，特点是你可以设置自己的大模型token</li>\n</ul>\n<ol start=\"2\">\n<li>设置个人token</li>\n</ol>\n<div><img src=\"https://scysoss.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/scys-images/zgic8zodrb_img1.png\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\"></div>\n<ol start=\"3\">\n<li>导航站来源</li>\n</ol>\n<div>哥飞社群里有收集大家做的导航站，这里大多数是支持谷歌登录和免费提交的\n<a href=\"https://new.web.cafe/topic/w3t6v6zc9m\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://new.web.cafe/topic/w3t6v6zc9m</a></div>\n<ol start=\"4\">\n<li>打开AIPex，准备你的基本资料，直接提交</li>\n</ol>\n<pre><div style=\"color: black; background: transparent; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; white-space: pre; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 0px; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: initial; display: block; border: none;\"><code class=\"language-javascript\" style=\"white-space: pre; color: black; background: none; text-shadow: white 0px 1px; font-family: Consolas, Monaco, &quot;Andale Mono&quot;, &quot;Ubuntu Mono&quot;, monospace; font-size: 1em; text-align: left; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none;\"><span>我的网站地址是 xxx</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">com</span><span> ，用 xx语言，根据这个网站的列表https</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">:</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 119, 170);\">new</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">web</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(153, 153, 153);\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\">cafe</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>topic</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"color: rgb(154, 110, 58); background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);\">/</span><span>w3t6v6zc9m，\n</span>进行批量提交</code></div></pre>",
